# Release-archive contents
# ------------------------
# `export-ignore` paths are omitted from `git archive` output, which is what
# GitHub serves as the release source tarball and what Zenodo mints a DOI for.
# The manuscript source is kept on the default branch (it is synced with
# Overleaf) but excluded from the archived release, which is a code release.
ms/               export-ignore
.gitattributes    export-ignore

# Binary assets — do not attempt line-ending conversion or textual diffs.
*.nc    binary
*.npz   binary
*.png   binary
*.pdf   binary
*.tab   -text
*.dat   -text

# Fortran sources are text; normalise line endings in the repository.
*.F90   text
*.py    text
*.md    text
